# T-1011: Tree[Int] <: Tree[Number] via Covariant annotation.
# [let a@Covariant] marks the type parameter as covariant — subtyping is covariant in `a`.
# The body [node: a] is a named-key record annotation (not a constructor), so no
# runtime constructors are injected. TypeAlias Tree entry is skipped at runtime.
# Absence of === warn asserts annotation_to_variance("Covariant") resolves cleanly.
[
  Tree: [type [let a@Covariant] [node: a]]
  result: true
]
=== out
Dict({"Tree": Dict({}), "result": Bool(true)})
